
  We've found a bug for you!
  ServerWithEntrypoint.res:3:1-15

  1 │ @@weft.server
  2 │ 
  3 │ @weft.component({kind: Entrypoint})
  4 │ let make = (~label: string) => label
  5 │ 

  @weft.component: an entrypoint is loaded by the client, so it can't be in a file marked server-only (@@weft.server, at line 1)

